45,2,3,talk,Midori,,We need a program that fits within existing on-site capacity.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,Chronic care coordination might work if we can manage the data links.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Misaki,,Perinatal support could use the midwifery slack without straining therapy.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,Home follow-up is financially risky given the tariff rules.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Day rehabilitation needs dedicated space, which we are short on.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am leaning towards something that uses existing staff effectively.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,We must avoid repeating the joint clinic mistake.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
